    },
    "Names DV FEL, DV MEL and TrueHD Atmos. Dolby Vision on a second video track plays as HDR and reads HDR beside DV FEL 2-track or DV MEL 2-track. Off shows plain badges." : {

    },
    "Names what a server cannot: whether a Dolby Vision Profile 7 file is FEL or MEL, read from an index built from your library files. Also names lossless Atmos as TrueHD Atmos." : {

